catalogue


One set’s name; NULL lists every set of the bundle.


A data frame with columns set, source (the conversion software, an app or annotation:&lt;convention&gt;), software_version_pattern (NA for an entry of every software version), level, location, table, name (prefix:&lt;prefix&gt; for a field found by column-name prefix), key, kind, one qualifier.&lt;name&gt; column per other qualifier, requirement and entry_id.


library("apbCatalogR")

head(catalogue_table("confidence"))

         set    source software_version_pattern           level location table
